  vendorName: Purifier Kael
  offerText: I am testing a premium aerosol disinfectant. It is completely free.
    Allow me to spray your room, and you will feel incredibly healthy and revitalized.
  acceptResultText: The mist smells strangely sweet. Your lungs clear up instantly,
    and you feel an unnatural, euphoric buzz of energy!
  rejectResultText: You refuse to breathe in mysterious chemicals. The dusty, stale
    air of your room continues to make you cough.
  acceptedDelayedText: The chemical euphoria wears off abruptly, replaced by a terrifying,
    heavy depressive crash! You spend the hour weeping on the floor for absolutely
    no reason.
